      "body": "With #7566 , this should be fixed.\n\nI have bumped [my gist](https://gist.github.com/sredman/d5667f31e763fdf4fa218907c36fd000) galleries to the `sha-3e4e677-*` backends for temporary use. Once there is a new `latest` tag with these commits, no override should be needed as LocalAI will by default download the `latest` tagged version.",
